Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:28:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Hide Open model (Ctrl+Shift+O); Export model on tab 3

- no model buttons in the header any more
- Open model: Ctrl+Shift+O or the file name on the command line (instructors)
- Export model... in the MODEL card of tab 3 (and Ctrl+E): writes the
  current values with export time and source model; the program keeps
  working with the open model

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYtgVzosoCtciR6GN6D2KT
